,{"tag":"mn","text":"1"},{"tag":"mo","attrs":{"stretchy":"false"},"text":")"}]}},{"id":"answer","kind":"component","type":"answer","data":{"label":"最终答案 · 正值","title":"侧面积正在增加","detail":"正号表示增加，mm²/s 表示每秒增加的面积。","math":{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mfrac","children":[{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","text":"d"},{"tag":"mi","text":"S"}]},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","text":"d"},{"tag":"mi","text":"t"}]}]},{"tag":"mo","text":"="},{"tag":"mn","text":"28"},{"tag":"mi","text":"π"},{"tag":"mtext","text":"  "},{"tag":"msup","children":[{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","attrs":{"mathvariant":"normal"},"text":"m"},{"tag":"mi","attrs":{"mathvariant":"normal"},"text":"m"}]},{"tag":"mn","text":"2"}]},{"tag":"mi","attrs":{"mathvariant":"normal"},"text":"/"},{"tag":"mi","attrs":{"mathvariant":"normal"},"text":"s"}]},"mathLabel":"\\frac{dS}{dt}=28\\pi\\;\\mathrm{mm}^2/\\mathrm{s}"}},{"id":"check","kind":"prose","nodes":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"这一步既检查数值，也检查量纲。变化率与当前面积不是同一个量。"}]}]}],"viewVersion":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 让结论带上单位与含义\n\n教学示例：圆柱**侧面积** \\(S=2\\pi rh\\)。当前半径 7 mm、高度 7 mm，两者的增长率均为 1 mm/s。不把侧面积混同于包含底面的总表面积。\n\n\n\n乘积法则\n\\[\\frac{dS}{dt}=2\\pi\\left(h\\frac{dr}{dt}+r\\frac{dh}{dt}\\right)=2\\pi(7\\times1+7\\times1)\\]\n\n最终答案 · 正值\n侧面积正在增加\n\n\\frac{dS}{dt}=28\\pi\\;\\mathrm{mm}^2/\\mathrm{s}\n(dS)/(dt)=28π  mm^(2)/s\n正号表示增加，mm²/s 表示每秒增加的面积。\n\n这一步既检查数值，也检查量纲。变化率与当前面积不是同一个量。"}]}